      "description": "<p>Result is a victory for prime minister Mark Carney and supporters of Canadian unity</p><p>Voters in Canada’s Alberta have overwhelmingly rejected a proposal to begin a process towards independence, delivering a victory for the prime minister, Mark Carney, and supporters of Canadian unity.</p><p>With more than 1.5m votes counted, 76% supported remaining in Canada, while close to 24% backed beginning a process toward separation, according to unofficial results from Elections Alberta.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/20/canada-alberta-rejects-independence-succession-referendum\">Continue reading...</a>",
